      "extract": "The Iwasawa decomposition of $\\GL{\\H}=\\RR\\UU \\Sp = \\Sp \\RR \\UU $ allows us to define: \\begin{definition} The \\emph{dressing action} of $\\RR\\UU$ on $\\Sp$ is the map $\\RR\\UU\\times \\Sp \\rightarrow \\Sp $ given by $(G,K)\\mapsto K'$ where $G \\cdot K = K' \\cdot R \\cdot U$ for the unique $R\\in\\RR$ and $U\\in\\UU$. \\end{definition} Our goal of this section is to relate the orbits of the dressing action with the tetraplectic",
